# delta_mesh_cell + delta_mesh_fabric_<X>x<Y>x<Z> -- the delta mesh
# router cell (9 ports: +/-X, +/-Y, +/-Z, P_DIA, P_DIA2, local; head-flit
# header in TUSER, route_table RAM with power-on DOR image + in-band
# config on the local port, per-VC input buffers with credit flow
# control) and the mesh fabric top that grids it (boundary cells'
# local ports exposed as s_local_*/m_local_* arrays, per-cell drop
# counters as o_err[NUM_BOUNDARY], per-cell mode-ack tallies as
# o_mode_acks[NUM_BOUNDARY], per-cell DFT-active flags as
# o_dft_active[NUM_BOUNDARY]).
#
# Generated by projects/components/fabric-gen-ip/delta/bin/delta_generator.py
#   --topology mesh --cells-x 4 --cells-y 4
#   --cells-z 1 --user-width 64
#   (checked-in artifact from the default 4x4x1 config).
#
# Sources: FIFO primitives first (the cell's per-port per-VC input
# buffers instantiate gaxi_fifo_sync, which needs fifo_control and
# counter_bin), then the house arbiter_matrix (Task 7: one instance
# per output port), then the cell -- the fabric top references the
# cell module. The only other dependencies are `reset_defs.svh` and
# `fifo_defs.svh`, included below so the list is self-contained
# outside the area flow.
# Root path token is $REPO_ROOT.

